Hi {Owner},

I build websites for deck and patio builders around {City}. {Business Name} has strong deck and pergola work on its social pages, but nothing comes up as a site when someone searches for a deck builder here.

Rather than ask for your time first, I built a sample: projects sorted by deck, pergola and covered patio, a design-visit form that asks size and height, and a page on permits and inspections, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

